      "content": "You are not a bystander to everything, but a witness to your own journey, and that is enough to call you a good person. The idea that you are simply taking up space is a trap that keeps you stuck, but it can be rewritten as a promise that you will occupy the space of someone who matters. You can fix what feels rotten by letting it be part of who you are, not by trying to erase it.",
